From 13becedeaa0d3c0e097e432af7f5e5da4488a31a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: liteprofiler-build <liteprofiler-build@local>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:12:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add LiteProfiler instrumentation (v1+v2, thread-level
 reproduction)

Reproduced from lite-profiler-desc.md sections 1-4 and 7 only (the author
reference image and patches are not available).

v1: LiteScope/phase instrumentation in vllm (15 modified files + 5 new files
under vllm/utils) plus the matching probe points in vllm-ascend (2 files).
v2: EngineCore.profile() three-branch behaviour and profile api_router
mounting without a torch profiler.

Deviations from the natural-language description, all documented in
.research/LITEPROFILER_IMAGE.md:
  * thread-level records: every row carries tid (threading.get_native_id)
    and pid; the phase lane is per thread (LITEPROFILER_REQUIREMENTS.md 2.1/2.2);
  * LiteProfiler summary is also emitted on the early-return --profile path of
    benchmarks/latency.py;
  * topdown_torch merge runs after the trace has been written.
